creening tool used to identify patients at risk of malnutrition.", "DUODENOPANCREATECTOMÍA:Duodenopancreatectomy is a surgical procedure that involves the removal of the duodenum and a portion of the pancreas. This operation is often performed in cases of pancreatic cancer or gastric cancer, making it a critical intervention for patients suffering from these conditions. The procedure can lead to complications such as diabetes and malabsorption, which are important considerations in the management of patients post-surgery. Overall, duodenopancreatectomy is utilized primarily in the treatment of pancreatic diseases, highlighting its significance in surgical oncology.", "ERAS SOCIETY:The ERAS Society is an organization dedicated to enhancing perioperative care, with a particular emphasis on improved recovery following surgery. It provides comprehensive guidelines aimed at optimizing surgical recovery processes. Among its recommendations, the ERAS Society specifically addresses the needs of patients undergoing pancreaticoduodenectomy, ensuring that best practices are implemented to facilitate better outcomes in surgical recovery.", "K. LASSEN:K. Lassen es uno de los autores de las guías para el cuidado perioperatorio en la cirugía pancreática, contribuyendo a la investigación en nutrición clínica.", "GASTROYEYUNOSTOMÍA:La gastroyeyunostomía es un procedimiento quirúrgico que conecta el estómago con el yeyuno, utilizado en el contexto de la cirugía pancreática.", "DRENES:Los drenajes son dispositivos utilizados para eliminar fluidos del cuerpo después de una cirugía, en este caso, tras la duodenopancreatectomía.", "DEHISCENCIA DE ANASTOMOSIS:DEHISCENCIA DE ANASTOMOSIS refers to anastomotic dehiscence, which is a complication that occurs post-surgery. This condition indicates a failure of the surgical connection between two segments of the intestine, leading to a separation of the anastomosis. It is a significant concern in surgical procedures involving intestinal reconnections, as it can result in serious complications for the patient.", "MJ:MJ is an author who contributed to the chapter on nutrition in surgical patients in the book 'Tratado de Nutrición'.", "RAMÍREZ RODRÍGUEZ JM:Ramírez Rodríguez JM is an author who contributed to the chapter on nutrition in surgical patients in the book 'Tratado de Nutrición'.", "GIMENO ORNA JA:Gimeno Orna JA is an author who contributed to the chapter on nutrition in surgical patients in the book 'Tratado de Nutrición'.", "NUTRICIÓN EN PACIENTE QUIRÚRGICO:A chapter in the book 'Tratado de Nutrición' discussing nutrition in surgical patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}